    "long_instructions": "## Reflect\r\nGoal: Use your results to write when your model should and should not be used.\r\n\r\nClick the zoom **+** in the bottom corner of the map.\r\n\r\nMove your Data Scientist to each stop as you start it.\r\n- **Reflect Stop 1:** Copy the prediction from **New User** in your guide. Drag the ✓ or ✗ next to it to show if it is right for them.\r\n- **Reflect Stop 2:** Show your Project Map to two classmates. Each one copies a Visitor Note on your map and fills it in.\r\n- **Reflect Stop 3:** Read the visitor notes. Write your final model card.\r\n- **Reflect Stop 4:** Finish both sentences about your choices.\r\n\r\nYou are done when Reflect Stops 1–4 have an answer.",
